                  <span class="faith-topic-row-meta">
                    <span class="faith-topic-row-label">Thesis 1</span>
                    <span class="faith-topic-row-snippet">When our Lord and Master Jesus Christ said, “Repent” (Mt 4:17), he willed the entire life of believers to be one of repentance.</span>
                  </span>
