                  <span class="faith-topic-row-meta">
                    <span class="faith-topic-row-label">Thesis 2</span>
                    <span class="faith-topic-row-snippet">This word cannot be understood as referring to the sacrament of penance, that is, confession and satisfaction, as administered by the clergy.</span>
